    "chunk_id": "c5b5eb3fb8ceceda",
    "paper_id": "9b74b8d7-23de-466a-aeb9-ea2ed320b530",
    "text": "[5.2  Hardware and Schedule]\nWe trained our models on one machine with 8 NVIDIA P100 GPUs. For our base models using\nthe hyperparameters described throughout the paper, each training step took about 0.4 seconds. We\ntrained the base models for a total of 100,000 steps or 12 hours. For our big models,(described on the\nbottom line of table 3), step time was 1.0 seconds. The big models were trained for 300,000 steps\n(3.5 days).",
    "source_section": "5.2  Hardware and Schedule",
    "title": "Attention Is All You Need",
    "authors": [
