      "Llion Jones",
      "Aidan N. Gomez",
      "Łukasz Kaiser",
      "Illia Polosukhin"
    ],
    "year": 2023,
    "chunk_index": 47
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "9c2d824182504647",
    "paper_id": "1992d589-827f-4654-b8ab-8877f68275c0",
    "text": "[3.5  Positional Encoding]\nt tasks, many appear to exhibit behavior related to the syntactic\nand semantic structure of the sentences.",
    "source_section": "3.5  Positional Encoding",
