    "text": "[Operations]\nSelf-Attention               O(n2 · d)         O(1)            O(1)\nRecurrent                 O(n · d2)         O(n)           O(n)\nConvolutional              O(k · n · d2)        O(1)          O(logk(n))\nSelf-Attention (restricted)      O(r · n · d)         O(1)          O(n/r)",
    "source_section": "Operations",
    "title": "Attention Is All You Need",
    "authors": [
      "Ashish Vaswani",
      "Noam Shazeer",
