    "chunk_id": "62ea435299bcb767",
    "paper_id": "ab3be46d-60bd-4971-b246-7f77e1560799",
    "text": "[Abstract]\na small fraction of the training costs of thearXiv:1706.03762v7                           best models from the literature. We show that the Transformer generalizes well to\nother tasks by applying it successfully to English constituency parsing both with\nlarge and limited training data.\n∗Equal contribution. Listing order is random. Jakob proposed replacing RNNs with self-attention and started\nthe effort to evaluate this idea. Ashish, with Illia, designed and implemented the first Transformer models and\nhas b",
    "source_section": "Abstract",
