    "text": "[Huazhong University of Science and Technology]\nDistinguished Lecturer of the IEEE Communications Society. He was\nan associate editor for IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, an\neditor for the Computer Networks journal, and an editor for IEEE Wireless\nCommunication Magazine. He  is currently serving as the  editor-in-chief\nfor IEEE Transactions on Wireless Communications, an editor-at-large for\nIEEE/ACM Transactions on Networking, and an editor for IEEE Network.",
