    "text": "[Acknowledgments and Disclosure of Funding]\nThis work was supported by ONR PECASE and the NSF Graduate Research Fellowship under grant\nnumber DGE-1752814. Google’s TensorFlow Research Cloud (TFRC) provided Cloud TPUs.",
