    "text": "[D  Samples]\nset. Figure 7 shows multiple draws from the reverse process x0 ∼pθ(x0|xt) that\nshare the latent xt for t ∈{1000, 750, 500, 250}. To accomplish this, we run a single reverse chainfrom an initial draw from the prior. At the intermediate timesteps, the chain is split to sample multiple\nimages. When the chain is split after the prior draw at xT =1000, the samples differ significantly.\nHowever, when the chain is split after more steps, samples share high-level attributes like gender,\nhair color, eyewear, saturat",
