    "paper_id": "ca5c95d3-6fbd-4b14-a7e1-a4f249f8257d",
    "text": "[1. System Design]\nThe application accepts PDF uploads, stores document metadata in PostgreSQL, queues ingestion\nwith Celery and Redis, extracts paper metadata, writes knowledge graph nodes to Neo4j, and\nindexes text chunks in FAISS using deterministic hashing embeddings.",
