    "text": "[2. Expected Demo Behavior]\nA successful demo shows the paper in the document library, a paper node and author nodes in the\ngraph, a downloadable PDF endpoint, and a chat answer that mentions Gemini, FastAPI, Celery,\nNeo4j, FAISS, PostgreSQL, and Redis when asked about the system stack.",
